   "mark": null,
   "id": "never",
   "slot": null,
   "cut": true,
   "ladder": false,
   "drop": false,
   "quiet": false
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "floor": 1,
   "text": "Here's the bit nobody tells you.",
   "start": 40.235,
   "end": 42.504,
   "card": null,
   "mark": null,
   "id": "rule",
   "slot": null,
   "cut": false,
   "ladder": false,
   "drop": false,
   "quiet": false
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "floor": 1,
   "text": "In a rush, everyone chases the same prize, so the prize gets split a thousand ways.",
   "start": 43.059,
   "end": 48.786,
   "card": null,
   "mark": null,
   "id": "split",
   "slot": null,
   "cut": false,
   "ladder": false,
   "drop": false,
   "quiet": false
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "floor": 1,
   "text": "But every single one of them needs a pan. Gold or no gold, the pan man gets paid.",
   "start": 49.412,
   "end": 55.169,
   "card": null,
   "mark": null,
   "id": "pan",
   "slot": null,
   "cut": false,
   "ladder": false,
   "drop": false,
   "quiet": false
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "floor": 1,
   "text": "In 2008, two economists went back through the census records of 1850 and 1852 to check.",
   "start": 55.765,
   "end": 63.671,
   "card": [
    "1850 \u00b7 1852",
    "CENSUS RECORDS \u00b7 CLAY & JONES, 2008"
   ],
   "mark": 2008,
   "id": "census",
   "slot": null,
   "cut": false,
   "ladder": false,
   "drop": false,
   "quiet": false
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "floor": 1,
   "text": "For the miners, the gains were small, or even zero. For everyone else, positive, and large.",
   "start": 64.235,
   "end": 70.355,
   "card": [
    "SMALL OR EVEN ZERO",
    "FOR MINERS \u00b7 CLAY & JONES, 2008"
   ],
   "mark": null,
   "id": "verdict",
   "slot": null,
   "cut": true,
   "ladder": false,
   "drop": false,
   "quiet": false
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "floor": 1,
   "text": "Economists. Taking a hundred and sixty years to confirm what Sam worked out in an afternoon.",
   "start": 70.588,
   "end": 76.666,
   "card": null,
   "mark": null,
   "id": null,
   "slot": "e3",
   "cut": false,
   "ladder": false,
   "drop": false,
   "quiet": false
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "floor": 2,
   "text": "Now look at 2026. Everyone's digging for the same gold again. Apps. Agents. Startups.",
